### 34.6 Poll claim C until PENALTY_APPLIED (async)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/claims/{{claimC34_id}}
Authorization: Basic {{adminEmail}} {{adminPass}}

### 34.7 Tenant penaltyCount should be ≥3 after Kafka events drain
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/{{tenant34_id}}
Authorization: Basic {{adminEmail}} {{adminPass}}

### 34.8 Penalties for this tenant
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/penalties?tenantId={{tenant34_id}}
Authorization: Basic {{adminEmail}} {{adminPass}}

### 34.9 All APPLIED penalties in the system
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/penalties?status=APPLIED
Authorization: Basic {{adminEmail}} {{adminPass}}

### 34.10 Add a couple of messages to claim A and list them
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/claims/{{claimA34_id}}/messages
Authorization: Basic {{landlordEmail}} {{landlordPass}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "messageType": "LANDLORD_STATEMENT", "body": "Extra context after the fact." }

###
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/claims/{{claimA34_id}}/messages
Authorization: Basic {{adminEmail}} {{adminPass}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "messageType": "ADMIN_NOTE", "body": "Internal admin note." }

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/claims/{{claimA34_id}}/messages
Authorization: Basic {{landlordEmail}} {{landlordPass}}

### 34.11 History snapshot of each claim
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/claims/{{claimA34_id}}/history
Authorization: Basic {{adminEmail}} {{adminPass}}

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/claims/{{claimB34_id}}/history
Authorization: Basic {{adminEmail}} {{adminPass}}

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/claims/{{claimC34_id}}/history
Authorization: Basic {{adminEmail}} {{adminPass}}
